  "required": {
    "relaxivity": "r1 relaxivity of the contrast agent, /mM/s. NO DEFAULT IS POSSIBLE - the correct value depends on which agent was injected, so guessing it silently scales every concentration and every Ktrans. Preferred: put 'relaxivity' in the DCE image's JSON sidecar (dce2bids writes this for you), which also lets it vary per scan. Otherwise set it in your run config, or add it to this file's 'defaults' block if your site always uses one agent."
  },
